{title: All Who Are Thirsty}
{artist: Brenton Brown & Glenn Robertson}
{key: G}

{comment: Verse 1}
All who are [G]thirsty
All who are [Em7]weak
Come to the [C2]fountain
Dip your heart in the [Am]stream [G/B]of [C]life
Let the [Dsus]pain and the [G]sorrow
Be washed [Bm]away
In the waves of his [C2]mercy
As deep cries [Am7]out [G/B]to  [C]deep,  [Dsus]we sing

{comment: Chorus 1}
[G]Come [G2]Lord [Gsus]Je--[G2]sus [C2]come
[G]Come [G2]Lord [Gsus]Je--[G2]sus [C2]come

{comment: Chorus 2}
